  "docs.threeD.fieldImagesDesc2": "or a raw base64 image. Single image: 1 item; Tripo multi-image: 2 to 4 items in fixed order front, left, back, right — the platform automatically fills the upstream 4 slots and infers the image format. Volcano Yingmou allows up to 5, Shumei up to 4, and Seed3D requires exactly 1.",
